    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    Use this table as a starting checklist, not a complete list. Check the actual job description for your
    target role and industry for the specific tools and terms it names.
  </p>

  <h2 id="five-skills">The 5 foundational skills employers actually check</h2>

  <p>
    These five skills apply broadly across roles and industries in India. Not every job weighs them equally,
    but almost every job checks for some version of all five, whether formally or by simply watching how you
    behave in your first few weeks.
  </p>

