  <h2 id="build-portfolio">Build this skill portfolio free, in the right order</h2>

  <p>
    <strong>Building the right skill mix here is not just interview prep — it is how you start building a
    high-income skill portfolio that unlocks better roles and higher pay sooner</strong>, instead of waiting
    years for a degree alone to open the door. None of it requires paid coaching to start.
  </p>

